      "id": "claim_4100b9d91cac42b6958753287fb2f2dc",
      "statement": "FilesystemWalker performs full re-enumeration of a mounted directory on every run, with no delta or resume tokens; idempotency comes entirely from comparing file content hashes against stored hashes, not from pagination state.",
